  "title": "Contact Us",
  "content_html": "<div id=\"contentsArea\">\r\n<section id=\"outline\" class=\"narrow hideConf\">\r\n<p class=\"txtC\">This is the inquiry page of Orgiast Co., Ltd.<br>Please feel free to contact us with any questions about our services, requests for estimates, and more.</p>\r\n\r\n</section>\r\n<section id=\"phonenumber\" class=\"narrow hideConf\">\r\n<h2>PHONE NUMBER</h2>\r\n<div class=\"bgPic\">\r\n<img class=\"phone-picture jetpack-lazy-image\" src=\"/common/img/page/contactus/freedial_o.png\" alt=\"Phone Number\" data-lazy-src=\"/common/img/page/contactus/freedial_o.png?is-pending-load=1\" srcset=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7\"><noscript><img class=\"phone-picture\"\r\n     src=\"/common/img/page/contactus/freedial_o.png\" alt=\"電話番号\"></noscript>\r\n<ul class=\"listDisc\">\r\n \t<li>Please note that we cannot respond to solicitations for products or services using this phone number. Thank you for your understanding in advance.</li>\r\n \t<li>Business hours: Weekdays 10:00–18:00</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<Br>\r\n<h3>Experienced producers provide thorough support</h3>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- START UNITE GALLERY 1.7.62 -->\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t<div id='unitegallery_1_1' class='unite-gallery' style='margin:0px auto;'>\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img alt=\"orgiast-staff01\" src data-image=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/1.png?fit=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1\" data-thumb=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/1.png?fit=200%2C200&amp;ssl=1\" title style=\"display:none\"><noscript><img alt=\"orgiast-staff01\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t     src=\"\" data-image=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/1.png?fit=200%2C200&ssl=1\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t     data-thumb=\"https://i0.wp.com/www.orgiast.jp/wp/wp-content/uploads/2024/02/1.png?fit=200%2C200&ssl=1\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t     title=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t     style=\"display:none\"></noscript>\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\